                <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">Why do snoring and breathing problems occur together?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Both conditions often share the same underlying cause - airway obstruction. During sleep, relaxed tissues can both vibrate (causing snoring) and block airflow (causing breathing problems).</div></details>
                <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">How is this combination condition diagnosed?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Sleep study (polysomnography) and physical examination help identify both the snoring and any underlying breathing obstruction.</div></details>
                <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">What treatment addresses both issues?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Treatment targets the underlying airway obstruction, which resolves both snoring and breathing issues. CPAP, oral appliances, and surgery all address root causes.</div></details>
                <details class="group bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-lg [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-primary">Can treatment cure both snoring and breathing problems?<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition duration-300 group-open:-rotate-180">expand_more</span></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Yes, surgical treatment like MMA can permanently address the anatomical cause of both conditions. Non-surgical options effectively manage symptoms.</div></details>
